{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99897","id":2208967465,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Dqisp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99897","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99897.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99897.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99897","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99897/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99897/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99897/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/17db92b8b83b22d5054bc5ea00399903f522792b","number":99897,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Clarify API for top selected nodes in EditorSelection and make public","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The current API for EditorSelection has this `get_transformable_selected_nodes` function exposed to scripting:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"800\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-01 at 6 46 04 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a67d088-8eed-4852-9570-2264c0b29a65\">\r\n\r\nIt is not immediately obvious what \"transformable\" means. One could assume that it only returns Node3D/CanvasItem nodes since those have a global transform, but that is not correct, it can return plain `Node` nodes too. What it actually does is return top nodes, which is useful for transform operations. For example, if there is a node A with a child B and a sibling C, then selecting all three will cause this method to return only A and C. Changing the global transform of A will affect the global transform of B, so there is no need to change B separately.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, a problem with the current API is that the `TypedArray<Node>` version of this function is not available internally, which makes it impossible to write C++ code that works for both engine modules and GDExtension - you'd need `#if` directives to swap between this function and the internal `List<Node *>` version.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the following changes:\r\n\r\n* Rename `_get_transformable_selected_nodes` to `get_top_selected_nodes`.\r\n* Change the visibility of `get_top_selected_nodes` to public.\r\n* Expose the new name to scripting, but keep the old name as a deprecated alias to avoid breaking compatibility.\r\n* Rename the internal variable `selected_node_list` to `top_selected_node_list` for clarity.\r\n* For parity with the above, rename internal `get_selected_node_list` to `get_top_selected_node_list`.\r\n  * This part makes up over half of the files changed in this PR.\r\n  * This can break compatibility with third-party modules if they use this function.\r\n    * As such, we should exclude this part if we want to cherry-pick this to 4.4 and earlier to keep modules working within patch releases of the same minor version.\r\n* Update the documentation to clarify what this API does.\r\n\r\nNote: I did not change the other function that returns all selected nodes.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_e